            <title>[LU-21005] nodemap: add servergroup property to restrict client requests</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21005</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This is a proposal to add a new nodemap property named 'servergroup', off by default. It flags a nodemap whose members are Lustre servers. When nodemap is active, targets would reply with -EPERM to server-only request types that are sent from peers that belong to a nodemap without servergroup=1.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
